WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.699 --> 00:00:13.629
In 2011, the United Nations declared that
access to the Internet is a basic human right.

00:00:13.629 --> 00:00:19.380
By the time a glass of champagne goes flat,
two million bubbles will have popped.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:25.390
The 'Heil Hitler' salute is legal in Switzerland
as long as it's an expression of personal

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:26.390
opinion.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:33.090
An experiment showed that 6% of drivers will
deliberately swerve to kill animals.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:37.180
Humans speak more languages than there are
species of mammals.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.840
Plants can suffer from sexually transmitted
diseases.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:46.320
Statistically, the more rivers an area has,
the more languages will evolve there.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:50.560
If you put a can of Diet Coke in water, it
floats.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.320
Regular Coca-Cola sinks.

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:57.030
Because regular Coke contains sugar which
is denser than the sweeteners found in Diet

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.030
Coke.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:03.350
For the last five years, China has built a
new skyscraper every five days.

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:08.859
The sign for the female sex represents the
hand mirror of the Roman goddess Venus.

00:01:08.859 --> 00:01:15.149
More wine is drunk per head in Vatican City
than any other country on Earth.

00:01:15.149 --> 00:01:19.950
The inventor of roller skates first demonstrated
them by hurtling into a party while playing

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:23.009
the violin and crashing into a huge mirror.

00:01:23.009 --> 00:01:26.759
Whale milk has the consistency of toothpaste.

00:01:26.759 --> 00:01:28.790
Snake charming is illegal in India.

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:35.579
1 in 10 Americans think HTML is a sexually
transmitted disease.

00:01:35.579 --> 00:01:44.859
There is enough concrete in the Hoover Dam
to build a road across the US from coast to

00:01:44.859 --> 00:01:48.090
coast.

